Data from NIST (usnistgov/Circuits)
-----------------------------------
This repository uses data from the circuit repository of the National Institute of Standards
and Technology (NIST): https://github.com/usnistgov/Circuits, at commits
8366158a4324ef902ce740f29ddc9f7ebb1018b2 (seeds of the first maps, 2026-10) and
0876577bc2c9ce214a4c7f84b7f9b9eb02e5092f (the 53 maps added 2026-10-30), and NIST's list of
circuits,
https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/circuit-complexity/list-of-circuits. NIST is the source of
that data. NIST's terms for its data are at https://www.nist.gov/open/license.

Files derived from it, and how they were changed (2026-10-30 unless noted):
- circuits/<map>/<map>.mat.txt for the 53 maps of data/slp/2021-linearmaps: the matrices,
  renamed to one folder per map; a few rewritten from NIST's "EQUAL" form into 0/1 rows.
- search/seeds/<map>/nist-g<G>-d<D>.json: NIST's circuits for those maps and for AES
  InvMixColumns, the AES S-box bottom layer, FOX MU4/MU8 and Joltik, converted from NIST's
  circuit format into this repository's JSON format; each file names its NIST source. The
  S-box bottom seeds are the XOR-only tails of NIST S-box circuits, with XNOR constants moved
  into the map's affine constants and input wires permuted.
- The NIST columns of circuits/README.md: gate counts and depths read from NIST's files and
  its list of circuits.
- search/versions/v2-search-framework/, v3-... and v4-...: verbatim copies of NIST
  repository files (targets/nist/), as those versions used them (2026-10-24 to 10-28), and a
  saved copy of NIST's list-of-circuits web page (v4, targets/nist/invmixcolumns/).

Not every file in NIST's repository was made by NIST. Some circuits in those verbatim copies
are external contributions or come from published papers (for example AES S-box circuits
contributed by Milad Nasr, and circuits from github.com/umizame/S-box_29-AND,
github.com/xiangzejun/Optimizing_Implementations_of_Linear_Layers and
github.com/rub-hgi/shorter_linear_slps_for_mds_matrices, the last under the MIT license).
They keep their authors' rights and terms; this repository's licenses do not cover them.


Circuits from published work
----------------------------
Some seed circuits and comparison circuits kept in search/versions/ were transcribed from
published papers, including J. Jean (IACR ePrint 2026/1481) and the papers of Xiang et al.
and Yuan et al. They are credited in the files that hold them, keep their
authors' rights, and are not covered by this repository's licenses.


Redactions
----------
Before release, local home-directory paths, temporary paths and the machine's hostname were
replaced in run logs and archived run state (by "~", "<tmp>" and "host"). Hashes that cover
changed files were recomputed; the two rebuilt archives in
search/versions/v4-search-framework/targets/local/invmixcolumns/repository/sources/ record
their original hashes in their manifests.
